                  "severity": "important",
                  "label": "Validate discovery with rubric and hard-fail integrity: The AI stack is specified, but the plan does not preserve the rubric that decides whether recommendations are actually good. Without that gate, discovery can regress in tone or taste alignment while still looking technically complete",
